      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The contour of the epicardial coronary vessels may change considerably during coronary angioplasty. We report the extreme and unique \"accordion-like\" wrinkling of the mid right coronary artery as a result of distal guidewire entrapment during coronary angioplasty. Recognition of this artifact and its treatment may prevent further complications of coronary angioplasty."},
